msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"**VT、TTY 与 Linux 接口：** 补充标准 VT/键盘控制 ioctl、虚拟终端所有权交接和 ``termios`` ``OPOST`` 输出后处理；增加 ``/dev/tty0`` "
"对当前 VT 的解析。fbdev 结构布局与设备信息按 Linux ABI 补齐，包含稳定的显存映射长度、模式设置及图形设备 sysfs 链接；SVGA 帧缓冲 pitch 校验补上溢出保护。"
msgstr ""
"**VT, TTY, and Linux interfaces:** Added standard VT/keyboard control ioctls, virtual-terminal "
"ownership handoff, and ``termios`` ``OPOST`` output postprocessing; added resolution of "
"``/dev/tty0`` to the current VT. Completed fbdev layouts and device information against the Linux "
"ABI, including stable video-memory mapping lengths, mode setting, and graphics-device sysfs links;"
" added overflow protection to SVGA framebuffer pitch validation."

msgid ""
"**evdev、PS/2 与帧缓冲刷新：** evdev 使用按打开描述符独立的读取游标；缓冲区溢出时向受影响设备报告 ``SYN_DROPPED``，再以 ``SYN_REPORT`` "
"结束丢失区间、丢弃可能从半帧开始的旧积压，并从新事件继续，用户态可查询按键/绝对轴状态后重同步。IRQ12 只消费 8042 辅助设备字节，避免 PS/2 鼠标路径取走键盘字节、丢失按键释放。修正"
" VMware SVGA FIFO/trace 更新，并增加可让出锁的周期性整帧刷新与背压恢复路径。"
msgstr ""
"**evdev, PS/2, and framebuffer refresh:** evdev uses independent read cursors per open descriptor."
" On buffer overflow, affected devices receive ``SYN_DROPPED``, then ``SYN_REPORT`` ends the loss "
"interval, stale backlog potentially starting mid-frame is discarded, and reading resumes with new "
"events. Userspace can query key/absolute-axis state to resynchronize. IRQ12 consumes only 8042 "
"auxiliary-device bytes, preventing the PS/2 mouse path from stealing keyboard bytes and losing key"
" releases. Fixed VMware SVGA FIFO/trace updates and added periodic full-frame refresh with "
"yielding locks and backpressure recovery."

msgid ""
"**进程、共享内存与文件映射：** 实现 ``PR_SET_PDEATHSIG`` 和 ``PR_GET_PDEATHSIG``；补充 "
"``/proc/sys/kernel/overflowuid`` 与 ``overflowgid``，默认读值为 65534。已有 ``memfd_create`` "
"增加封印读取/添加及对写入、截断和可写映射的封印检查。System V ``shmget``、``shmat``、``shmdt``、``shmctl`` 的 syscall 编号在 5.0.0 "
"起点已存在，但当时内核没有对应处理器；本区间新增了内核实现，并补上共享映射在 fork、VMA 拆分和解除映射时的生命周期维护。另修正 ``mprotect``、``brk`` 与 SHM VMA"
" 扩展/拆分期间的状态处理。"
msgstr ""
"**Processes, shared memory, and file mappings:** Implemented ``PR_SET_PDEATHSIG`` and "
"``PR_GET_PDEATHSIG``; added ``/proc/sys/kernel/overflowuid`` and ``overflowgid``, reading 65534 by"
" default. Existing ``memfd_create`` gained seal queries/additions and seal checks for writes, "
"truncation, and writable mappings. System V ``shmget``, ``shmat``, ``shmdt``, and ``shmctl`` "
"syscall numbers existed at the 5.0.0 baseline but had no kernel handlers. This interval adds those"
" implementations and shared-mapping lifecycle handling for fork, VMA splits, and unmapping. Also "
"fixed state handling during ``mprotect``, ``brk``, and SHM VMA expansion/splitting."

msgid ""
"**音频：** 加入 Intel HDA 控制器、编解码器、PCM、ALSA 与 OSS 内核接口，并调整 AC97、ES1371 驱动接入内核音频层；导出对应 Linux 音频 UAPI。"
msgstr ""
"**Audio:** Added Intel HDA controller, codec, PCM, ALSA, and OSS kernel interfaces; adapted AC97 "
"and ES1371 drivers to the kernel audio layer and exported the corresponding Linux audio UAPI."

msgid ""
"**引导、驱动、存储与 PCI：** ``kernel.sys`` 带 Multiboot2 头并由 GRUB 直接引导；启动期间提前加载 IDT、屏蔽 PIC 并修正中断应答顺序。移除可加载 "
"``.drv`` 模型，六种驱动内建，并公开驱动类型常量。驱动按输入、网络、声音、TTY、USB、视频及存储职责迁移；存储代码从 bootstrap 汇总构建拆到 "
"``block/``、``fs/``、``drivers/storage/`` 等模块，拆分共享状态和跨模块接口并移除 unity build。PCI "
"初始化建立设备配置缓存，供后续查询复用，减少重复全总线枚举。"
msgstr ""
"**Boot, drivers, storage, and PCI:** ``kernel.sys`` contains a Multiboot2 header for direct GRUB "
"boot. Boot loads the IDT earlier, masks the PIC, and fixes interrupt acknowledgment order. Removed"
" loadable ``.drv`` support, built in six drivers, and published driver type constants. Drivers "
"moved by input, network, sound, TTY, USB, video, and storage responsibilities. Storage moved from "
"the bootstrap aggregate build into ``block/``, ``fs/``, ``drivers/storage/``, and other modules, "
"splitting shared state and cross-module interfaces and removing unity builds. PCI initialization "
"creates a device-configuration cache reused by later queries to reduce repeated full-bus "
"enumeration."

msgid ""
"**调度、系统调用与时间：** EEVDF 公平队列加入增强红黑树索引以辅助实体筛选；等待队列锁、单页写权限检查、管道批量复制和系统调用返回路径均有优化，管道容量由 4 KiB 增至 65535 "
"字节。CPU ID 读取优先使用 ``IA32_TSC_AUX`` 配合 ``RDPID``/``RDTSCP``，早期启动或不支持时回退 APIC 路径，避免支持该特性的 CPU "
"在系统调用路径上读 LAPIC MMIO。每 CPU 当前任务指针将系统调用帧捕获从任务表扫描改为 O(1)，未变化的用户 FS 基址不再重复写 "
"MSR；同一任务续跑且无信号或重调度需求时跳过完整调度轮次，唤醒的任务会在下一用户返回边界触发重调度，并在返回用户态时仅于地址空间或映射变化后重载 "
"CR3。没有待处理信号且无需切换任务时也免去不必要的 FPU 保存/恢复。增加基于 TSC 的 tick 间时间插值、``clock_gettime``/``clock_getres`` vDSO"
" 快路径，以及身份查询和时间类系统调用的轻量分发，省去这些不访问文件描述符的路径上的标准输入物化与归属扫描；不支持或不可信的时钟路径仍回退系统调用。"
msgstr ""
"**Scheduling, syscalls, and time:** Added an augmented red-black-tree index to aid EEVDF fair-"
"queue entity selection. Optimized wait-queue locks, single-page write-permission checks, batched "
"pipe copying, and syscall return paths; pipe capacity grew from 4 KiB to 65535 bytes. CPU ID reads"
" prefer ``IA32_TSC_AUX`` with ``RDPID``/``RDTSCP``, falling back to APIC during early boot or when"
" unsupported, avoiding LAPIC MMIO reads in syscall paths on capable CPUs. Per-CPU current-task "
"pointers make syscall-frame capture O(1) instead of a task-table scan; unchanged user FS bases no "
"longer rewrite MSRs. Continuing the same task without signals or rescheduling skips a full "
"scheduling round; awakened tasks request rescheduling at the next user-return boundary. CR3 "
"reloads on return to userspace only after address-space or mapping changes. Unnecessary FPU "
"save/restore is also skipped without pending signals or task switches. Added TSC interpolation "
"between ticks, ``clock_gettime``/``clock_getres`` vDSO fast paths, and lightweight dispatch for "
"identity/time syscalls, avoiding stdin materialization and ownership scans in paths without "
"descriptor access. Unsupported or untrusted clocks still fall back to syscalls."

msgid "**输入唤醒与内存访问：** 修正事件等待、信号与输入设备间的唤醒和竞态处理，避免输入积压/丢失；改进等待队列锁竞争及用户缓冲区单页可写检查路径。"
msgstr ""
"**Input wakeups and memory access:** Fixed wakeup and race handling among event waits, signals, "
"and input devices to avoid input backlog/loss; improved wait-queue lock contention and single-page"
" user-buffer writability checks."

msgid ""
"**日志与控制台：** 统一内核和驱动日志等级及驱动日志回调，默认使用低饱和 ANSI 颜色；启动命令行的 ``logcolor=0`` 可从第一条内核日志关闭配色。启动日志在 ``boot "
"complete`` 后保留于 tty1，PID 1/OpenRC 输出接续现有文本和光标位置，不清屏；日志纳入 tty1 历史，切换 VT "
"后仍可恢复。未显式重定向或关闭的标准输入、输出、错误共享同一个读写 ``/dev/console`` 打开描述，打开时绑定当前 VT，提供终端读写、termios、窗口尺寸和 VT "
"ioctl，但不会自动取得控制终端。"
msgstr ""
"**Logging and console:** Unified kernel/driver log levels and driver log callbacks, using muted "
"ANSI colors by default. Boot argument ``logcolor=0`` disables color from the first kernel log. "
"Boot logs remain on tty1 after ``boot complete``; PID 1/OpenRC output continues existing "
"text/cursor positions without clearing, and logs enter tty1 history for restoration after VT "
"switching. Unless explicitly redirected or closed, stdin/stdout/stderr share one read/write "
"``/dev/console`` open file description bound to the current VT at open. It provides terminal I/O, "
"termios, window size, and VT ioctls without automatically acquiring a controlling terminal."

msgid "**构建与开发工具：** 增加锁定依赖 URL 的 ``fetch-check`` 探测和 vDSO 测试工具；移除内核源码对宿主 libc 头文件的依赖。"
msgstr ""
"**Build and development tools:** Added ``fetch-check`` probes for pinned dependency URLs and vDSO "
"test tools; removed kernel source dependencies on host libc headers."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid "是，以下接口、构建方式和源码路径发生不兼容变化："
msgstr "Yes. The following interfaces, build methods, and source paths changed incompatibly:"

msgid ""
"**可加载驱动：** ``.drv`` 运行时装载、扫描和卸载机制及对应构建产物、``drivers`` 构建目标已移除。mouse、serial、e1000、AC97、ES1371 和 HDA "
"驱动内建于 ``kernel.sys``；驱动管理控制操作返回 ``-EOPNOTSUPP``。驱动列表接口仍保留；驱动 kernel API "
"表另有扩展，不能据此认为其尺寸保持不变，详见下文验证限制。"
msgstr ""
"**Loadable drivers:** Removed ``.drv`` runtime loading, scanning, unloading, corresponding "
"artifacts, and the ``drivers`` build target. mouse, serial, e1000, AC97, ES1371, and HDA are built"
" into ``kernel.sys``; driver-management control returns ``-EOPNOTSUPP``. Driver-list queries "
"remain. The driver kernel API table was also extended, so its size must not be assumed unchanged; "
"see validation limitations below."

msgid ""
"**引导链：** ``loader.elf``、``boot/loader/``、boot handoff 头文件及 loader 专属的完整性检查配置已移除。``kernel.sys`` 成为 "
"Multiboot2 目标。"
msgstr ""
"**Boot chain:** Removed ``loader.elf``, ``boot/loader/``, boot handoff headers, and loader-"
"specific integrity-check configuration. ``kernel.sys`` is now the Multiboot2 target."

msgid ""
"**旧名兼容头：** ``include/leonos/``、``include/uapi/leonos/`` 和 ``kernel/reliefnt/include/ntclks/`` "
"转发头树已删除；应使用对应的 ``reliefos`` 公共头或 ``reliefnt`` 内核私有头。"
msgstr ""
"**Legacy-name compatibility headers:** Deleted forwarding header trees ``include/leonos/``, "
"``include/uapi/leonos/``, and ``kernel/reliefnt/include/ntclks/``. Use the corresponding "
"``reliefos`` public or ``reliefnt`` private kernel headers."

msgid ""
"**旧构建兼容输入：** ``LEONOS_TEST_PYTHON``、``LEONOS_BUILD_OWNER`` 回退变量及 ``.leonos-out`` 旧输出目录标记不再识别。旧 "
"``loader`` 构建目标也已取消。"
msgstr ""
"**Legacy build compatibility inputs:** Fallback variables ``LEONOS_TEST_PYTHON`` and "
"``LEONOS_BUILD_OWNER`` and the old ``.leonos-out`` output marker are no longer recognized. The old"
" ``loader`` build target is also removed."

msgid ""
"**退役组件配置：** 删除 cmd 的 ``LEON_COMPONENT_TOOL_CMD_*`` Kconfig 开关及 ``RELIEFOS_LAYOUT_OPT_CMD`` "
"布局宏，并删除旧图形 Ping 的 ``LEON_COMPONENT_APP_PING_*`` 开关。外部配置片段和构建脚本应移除这些输入，不再依赖它们选择组件或路径。"
msgstr ""
"**Retired component configuration:** Removed cmd's ``LEON_COMPONENT_TOOL_CMD_*`` Kconfig switches "
"and ``RELIEFOS_LAYOUT_OPT_CMD`` layout macro, plus old graphical Ping's "
"``LEON_COMPONENT_APP_PING_*`` switches. External configuration fragments and build scripts should "
"remove these inputs and no longer use them to select components or paths."

msgid ""
"**源码目录：** 驱动按职责移入 "
"``drivers/input/``、``drivers/net/``、``drivers/sound/``、``drivers/tty/``、``drivers/usb/``、``drivers/video/``"
" 和 ``drivers/storage/``；存储实现拆分到 ``block/``、``fs/``、``firmware/`` 等目录，原 "
"``drivers/bootstrap/storage/`` 路径不再适用。"
msgstr ""
"**Source directories:** Drivers moved by responsibility into ``drivers/input/``, ``drivers/net/``,"
" ``drivers/sound/``, ``drivers/tty/``, ``drivers/usb/``, ``drivers/video/``, and "
"``drivers/storage/``. Storage implementations split into ``block/``, ``fs/``, ``firmware/``, and "
"other directories; ``drivers/bootstrap/storage/`` no longer applies."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid ""
"更新 GRUB 配置及自有引导脚本，改为通过 Multiboot2 直接加载 ``kernel.sys``；不要再依赖 ``loader.elf`` 或旧 boot handoff 数据结构。"
msgstr ""
"Update GRUB configuration and custom boot scripts to load ``kernel.sys`` directly through "
"Multiboot2; no longer depend on ``loader.elf`` or old boot handoff structures."

msgid "自定义 ``.drv`` 驱动需纳入内核源码和链接配置，使用内建驱动描述符注册；调用驱动运行时控制接口的程序应处理 ``-EOPNOTSUPP``。"
msgstr ""
"Custom ``.drv`` drivers must enter kernel source/link configuration and register through built-in "
"driver descriptors. Programs using runtime driver control must handle ``-EOPNOTSUPP``."

msgid ""
"将包含路径从已删除的 ``leonos``/``ntclks`` 兼容树改为 ``include/reliefos/``、``include/uapi/reliefos/`` 和 "
"``kernel/reliefnt/include/reliefnt/`` 下的现行头文件。"
msgstr ""
"Replace include paths from removed ``leonos``/``ntclks`` compatibility trees with current headers "
"under ``include/reliefos/``, ``include/uapi/reliefos/``, and "
"``kernel/reliefnt/include/reliefnt/``."

msgid ""
"更新外部构建脚本引用的驱动、存储源码路径及构建目标。若脚本显式传递旧测试解释器或构建所有权变量，应改用 "
"``RELIEFOS_TEST_PYTHON``、``RELIEFOS_BUILD_OWNER``；旧输出目录标记无法由当前清理脚本识别，建议为新版构建使用新的 ``O=`` 输出目录。"
msgstr ""
"Update external scripts' driver/storage source paths and build targets. Replace explicit legacy "
"test-interpreter or build-ownership variables with ``RELIEFOS_TEST_PYTHON`` and "
"``RELIEFOS_BUILD_OWNER``. Current cleanup scripts cannot recognize the old output marker; a fresh "
"``O=`` output directory is recommended for new builds."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid "驱动当前静态链接进 ``kernel.sys``，存储代码按独立职责拆分并移除了 unity build；外部构建清单需与新目录和对象边界同步。"
msgstr ""
"Drivers are currently statically linked into ``kernel.sys``; storage is split by responsibility "
"without unity builds. External build manifests must follow the new directory and object "
"boundaries."

msgid "EEVDF 公平队列使用增强红黑树辅助索引；该实现不意味着队列的所有操作路径都具有相同的渐进复杂度。"
msgstr ""
"The EEVDF fair queue uses an augmented red-black-tree auxiliary index; this does not imply equal "
"asymptotic complexity for every queue operation."

msgid "vDSO 快路径受支持的时钟类型及 TSC 信任条件限制，其他情况由内核系统调用路径处理。"
msgstr ""
"vDSO fast paths are limited by supported clocks and TSC trust conditions; other cases use kernel "
"syscall paths."

msgid "``make fetch-check`` 用于探测依赖锁文件记录的 URL 状态，不替代依赖获取或内容校验。"
msgstr ""
"``make fetch-check`` probes URL status from dependency lockfiles; it replaces neither dependency "
"fetching nor content verification."

msgid ""
"后续版本遵循 `仓库长期发布规范 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__：以版本提交确定 "
"``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]`` 范围，标签必须指向本次版本提交的完整 SHA；只汇总本仓有效变更并提供 compare 链接。两仓说明分别审阅，版本号和纯 merge "
"不列为更新；源码发布使用标签与 GitHub 自动源码归档，二进制仅在明确选择后从本版重建并附校验和及归属信息。发布说明从正文文件发布并回读核对，VMware 状态在完成前持续标明未完成。"
msgstr ""
"Future versions follow the `repository's long-term release rules "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__: version "
"commits determine the ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]`` range, and tags must point to the current version "
"commit's full SHA. Summarize only effective changes here and provide a compare link. Review the "
"repositories' notes separately, omitting version bumps and pure merges. Source releases use tags "
"and GitHub automatic source archives; binaries require explicit selection, rebuilding from this "
"version, checksums, and attribution. Publish notes from a body file and read them back for "
"verification. Keep VMware marked incomplete until validation finishes."

msgid "验证与已知限制"
msgstr "Validation and Known Limitations"

msgid "内核宿主普通、ASan、UBSan 工具测试通过；``test-header-export`` 通过，检查 81 个头文件。"
msgstr ""
"Normal, ASan, and UBSan kernel host tool tests passed; ``test-header-export`` passed, checking 81 "
"headers."

msgid ""
"``make test`` 未通过：``test-abi`` 中 ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api`` golden 大小为 168，当前 ABI 大小为 "
"296。当前接口增加了 PCI、DMA、IRQ、音频、日志等回调；未修改 ABI golden，也未修改音频 manifest。"
msgstr ""
"``make test`` failed: ``test-abi`` has a golden size of 168 for ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api``, "
"versus current ABI size 296. The interface added PCI, DMA, IRQ, audio, logging, and other "
"callbacks; neither ABI golden data nor the audio manifest was changed."

